From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP carve keeps the west edge

0070 missed the whole ray when it stepped into the corridor, so the floor
in the kept chunk never counted and the entity fell out of the world.
Stop that ray at the last kept chunk. The corridor is empty. Relocate
only an entity whose chunk key is in the hole. A box that crosses the
edge is not in it. Landing pads are a loaded chunk at least two chunks
off the hole with a motion-blocking floor. If that floor is not there,
leave the entity. The nearest-edge pads are the chunks that fall.
Not a new splitter. Post-applyAllPatches.
